{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 930,
  "batch_count": 1655,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "9c226cba1af606e532633417d9bfcf7f7d66a4bf",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a4171157f21f7076cc4f68a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最后200米处于前列进行名次争夺时\\n竞争力变强,速度也会加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "03ed7b9b916458bb4348d7eef6e4d583ff967793caef1c407661029e02f62389",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "10081"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92ea74f0f132cce6d5230e90",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘的弯道中，短时间内\\n会略微向前冲出，在泥地比赛中效果\\n增加并且加速力会少量提升\\n＜领放/先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "9592eeca6d63c1eb3648d9ac031470ec511e838e4413c195925cd6fa5811fe2f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100811"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3368916a56bea57615b39145",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道位于好位置时\\n短时间内速度提升,若是英里比赛\\n则效果时间增加",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdffce9a709cbef414fe214136862762b338124dd3d037ae440d430e0ba5aa24",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100821"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81eeb71b4db20042ab72ccf2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段附近往后的直线处\\n位于队伍中间时,提升速度,若此时为\\n下坡则持续提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "092dc8e8bbecfc4da1ffe3f6db97c0e6ecc12a220dee8302f402d9aadff7824d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100831"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92cb23ad53489a2bdc801b92",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘位于后方时,在最终直线处\\n解除自我封印向前突进,比赛场地为\\n东京竞马场中距离时,以极快速度向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8ac4543df0cb72f1ef14ee61bd053752dd11099d04642d2f5d5f59aada3c847",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100841"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae7ffe86cb141b1b60ef7c53",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "冷静地进行比赛,突入终盘时位于后方附近时\\n稍微向前突进,并略微威慑从领头开始\\n至多4名赛马娘",
      "source_fingerprint": "c09901fff9dac45f9fd6c8cec750f3cfc4ee2ab224a79793e62ec24da7e3d656",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100851"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b98c3988868a10c5e53a1ddf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "剩余1000m时若位于前方\\n则提高速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "0113b21e131ea68105d1b8cfdb68ba454a4ef1609cdd5ddd2fff1ce691c9962b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100861"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:179f39be7393dbac6dae4409",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "剩余400米,位于前方并被后方马娘紧追时\\n跑法让粉丝心中留下深刻印象\\n使自身更容易突围",
      "source_fingerprint": "25fbc0bfc7ff19d133c51eec68e328644501ab264ff738149844ce58df806e3e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100871"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9becf9a94e3a172bf9991f8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道位于队伍中间时\\n比赛剩余400m后速度提升\\n若是中距离赛在中盘有过赶超\\n则速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "806f23ab8260d3c7dc1a41fbd8ad78f1a82e0d138194d245ff8b460570a57a1a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100881"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78014798eba68866f10fb121",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段左右若位于前方\\n则速度提升,并回复少量体力\\n如果比赛距离在2400ｍ及以上\\n回复量增加",
      "source_fingerprint": "1de25e96d7ef61297f227b6ec7df30685cbedd0a7b8032cd23c319bb8fc993df",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100891"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84c70a2c2725d68e68db86aa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛前半的弯道中处于前方时\\n速度会在短时间内提升,如果是英里或中距离比赛\\n那么之后在终盘的最后直道被逼近时\\n会在短时间内稍微领先一些＜草地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "c38bea79edd9b046ed48ae3462d048e471196907c47f3c25a9b7708ce8f2cc08",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100901"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14a63840c5c4d2b746a7a943",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若身处前方,速度提升\\n并且稍微回复持久力＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "56637b52c607919a59aa37188dbbdfa678ef4686fc9d981bad99e10657d01904",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100901111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a16d24000dcac43dfb8ecba",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若身处前方\\n则回复持久力,并稍微提升速度\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "adc9c411403cfc8cf437a4bfa8f7259f4f4b46748421e834b1d660d8fc2df04b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100901211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81de516a76ca9cec2ac3052a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在上坡时,大幅回复持久力\\n＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "7326100cf3b6a163cbfb1a40cdfb0351381a2e5716f0c9982f3204fb158469f4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100902111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e24a305e7acd556383408cc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛中盘时若位于前方\\n则速度提升,之后最终冲刺时\\n加速度稍微提升＜领放・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b046126cc86b98ebc755447be20d03ddd562f1f3b1384453c30b4278f34540b9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100902121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8784287c09e3ea21cd0ccf1f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终直线上身处领先位置\\n并且后方一马身以内有其他赛马娘时\\n速度极大幅提升＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5e8701d4880e6e601decee3959266fddcf847e262f7ee723970a14edba8d0ea",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100902211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55610861d40eaaea5a3338c9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段前方位置\\n稍微发挥成为第一的力量",
      "source_fingerprint": "5159bc7c73dc7243415e3f78030362cfd7827c05ebc38e8b7781df2f7736d226",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "10091"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7001789ae92f6d841d37b10f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进入终盘最终直线时若位于队伍中间\\n则剩余300m之后速度少量提升\\n如果能冷静地进行比赛\\n则速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "a50faf9c9e4cbb4426abf9e0de083e6454ae1b0f150d6caae37bb251663bfda4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100911"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f57b6b12cbc57997a0ffc6f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段附近处于优势位置时\\n速度会提升\\n在中距离比赛中效果会增加",
      "source_fingerprint": "0edacc8dd6fc6a000f37e88c2947bfaa210f0644e24c7e0a3cfc165e7ffe3274",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100921"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce3b73f02c9be67aa832a129",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终盘初段的某处位于前方时\\n稍微向前突进,若是短距离或英里比赛\\n则提升技能效果",
      "source_fingerprint": "75cc601c8f765c52190c3e49283cdba2b860a734556a378faa16714745ded995",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100931"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:340e48df10bc780ebfd3e795",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛进行一半时位置处于中间梯队\\n则速度提升,若是中距离比赛\\n则速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "0aa259957fd8779ff8194c0c2ecf17c26a6b565893e08f3fee7bdfe478fd466f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100941"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9151f7990884097567026133",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛进入终盘时若位于前方\\n会小幅向前冲出\\n在短距离比赛中则会持续小幅向前冲出\\n直到抵达终点＜作战·先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c5cda5c9a80c0f4120d3e540e760dcdfef510f6d9b0a4a7395984b222467c5b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100951"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36b9411c1edf93ebbc2e7c9e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半的第3弯道处于中团时\\n速度会在短时间内提升\\n之后在终盘的最后直道尝试超越时\\n速度会稍微提升。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d492e56ef5799b4b6d417c4ac74575a12bf734d34e9f0d8734b557e30f718d3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100961"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:577c3a7c0eaead7d28324932",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "剩余300m的位置处在中游位置时\\n速度大幅提升,在中距离比赛发动\\n「冲动」技能的情况下技能效果变为\\n在比赛终盘的弯道无视名次提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "65922299b7f7aef3476e7d90dd801e153162c42b397838dfc9dbf061929706af",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100971"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f4390589836ff7b1758a3ef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在临近终盘时少量提升速度\\n并且根据发动的绿色技能数\\n额外提升速度和加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "781e5c7d01b63b93976e3da5e0797ddcd279880343f260c673af5f342bc1b1e7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100981"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd73bb09151e2e2ddb963371",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "沙土比赛时在中盘的弯道上竞争过后\\n在最后冲刺时处于好位置,加速度会略微上升\\n如果余力充足的话效果会上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "683e88c57b2ceedcc9eb55d283f8d687dbdb18de647b1c6c7362483e7208eb1a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100991"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d74c44fb1d6843d7183e256",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "剩余300m时位于前方,则速度少量提升\\n若在沙土比赛中与领头赛马娘距离较近时\\n再稍微向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab20a710261c3b100854927006fb38b23c4909c3222782960c68705dac174a2b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd7b506b4b6422a7be5168f7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘身处前方时\\n速度大幅提升＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "af7ab41c486c51e3aae795b6c3dd358692ef4c2f48fa7277352ef0b05ae7f622",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101001111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1db25f90a74a73fa41d50fd5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛中盘时若身处前方\\n速度大幅提升＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8f3df13a4da59c090b689d0730543fe7795280b43c0b9c249ed66d388f6273d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101001211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af3cf32110de5ea300038e51",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛中盘时若身处前方\\n速度大幅提升＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8f3df13a4da59c090b689d0730543fe7795280b43c0b9c249ed66d388f6273d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101002111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b442b765823003de477e7cb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘开始时若身处前方\\n则加速力大幅提升\\n并且视野稍微变得宽广＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4772a127d4a149946f23b1da01765114017fdf4f548af336b69493008ac3f2f3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101002211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aeb1a261d4f093077da0e0ef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘的弯道位于前方时\n持续一段时间稍微提升速度，英里\n比赛中则消耗少量持久力，在持续一段\n时间内极大提升速度<作战·先行>",
      "source_fingerprint": "124d6efaf9bf7e3e8419a30fb6b18fa731b7a280f7113c6f5f3e47aaeb854ca4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101003111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4dcb47b96862e331a567a14",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初期提早位于领放或\n试图超越时，或者在终盘初期\n提早提升加速度<先行·英里>",
      "source_fingerprint": "9552079716310fb4278bfebe98406ebf994d78bc92096645a56ed5b0a6ca736a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101003211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ea9883085dd21d9ac4bd405",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛前半段在队伍中间且前方或后方\\n长时间有赛马娘紧贴,则稍微回复体力\\n之后在比赛中段附近的直线处\\n短时间内速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "192967b7ab4c206b8e0b8d6babbb58b20d75859aaf1b2cf1085c882343eb1e9a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e56e47a698be39f8b5cba85",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于前方竞争时\n持续一段时间稍微提升速度\n此外若正在进行比拼，之后\n持续一段时间略微向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "f643f0e032eb72c270b2ab5de2c78595a104a19ce3499e1edb429189556f44dd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d08dc5c50a74eb60a8d5c223",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "第三弯道位于领头时,速度少量提升\\n并回复少量体力,若是东京竞马场\\n中距离比赛则增加技能持续时间",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d6725ada09a32804d6eee9a844988ab93df387d489918e5d5dd6e64abe6a444",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4fd6e351a04a2ea4dd44952",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段左右处在中间集团\\n速度提升,若是中距离比赛,且至此为止\\n发动过7次技能,则速度会大幅提高",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3eb42e7169b9d141cfd8312e6000de4dff610b3a192f302b08db9b28d15ecbb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f96ba4742494bf793f3e2ba",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道后半部分位于队伍中间时\\n速度持续少量提升,且在长距离比赛\\n低人气的情况下,速度持续大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "c87c057bc2d343821a6776f99cfcfebe8f8d412c54a00be16d7c2528f982aad4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d237391c07fcd0904608ccd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终直线位于领头时\\n速度少量提升,并根据进入终盘前\\n取得的领先距离提供额外速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "19caeb4eeb15646eaad2cb96123f97e4869a76f5422be75a0ee4fea7625189ae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85ac1fa614c20655d678a68e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中段位于后方时速度提升\\n之后在终盘的最终弯道处\\n准备超越时\\n短时间内稍微向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "3575e0a6225b015c6943337b6efd8e0fe95905e4d0029761cf0c67fd44f77b45",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101081"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bff239de9af90a808d7e6ba",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛前半段的弯道若位于队伍中间\\n则少量提升速度,若是短距离或英里比赛\\n则变为少量持续提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "a59cbc24a6c830446e9946d819cff3c1c3c9ea4c6b16890026e8ed52d6521df2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101091"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76ae0393de58ee15c3fb3b7d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛剩余800m自身位于队伍中间\\n则短时间内小幅向前突进并略微提升加速度\\n若是根干距离的比赛且自身位于后方\\n则额外提供微量的加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "aadd28db393aaf940700148a3e44cb9c4f229b5e2d0e659fb725704dbaec4f3e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a637b96ae021180161977c64",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时,速度大幅提升\\n＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "f98a597a24bd90cd97b6102a0150b1b58dac908f579a469896e93e1290bc96b3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101101111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d575ec15233d1e38f9c1ae9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘开始时若位于中团以后位置\\n加速度提升,视野稍微变得宽广\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d5c9dac5a979cb3ae2d0150c2ce0a9e7c149c7bf521bbf6b6221ebb18d3c142",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101101211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30f4dddd251d9ed5464cfb97",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时,回复持久力\\n并且稍微提升速度＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd4d347c2609ea0af037acaddda38b4346cf4f067b45c5ad28e2a6633fc673ae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101102111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9c761eabe479e077d76eaa1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若位于中团以后的位置\\n则回复持久力并稍微提升速度\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d39ed86fb15ae53852e08a134457bdf903a4822123a0b4dfa2ec2ff063ff0f76",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101102211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27475e8ce2ed4daa8e7fdb7e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘的直线消耗耐力\\n使速度极大提升,若是中山赛场的\\n长距离比赛,则不消耗耐力\\n并提升技能效果＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e812906fcb58339006fd25ada2982a96effad012b540e94ebba4db1870ed32c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101103111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc004626c907980270da3214",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终弯道及往后时\\n若对手赛马娘发动速度技能\\n则一段时间内向前突进＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "84b8ec538867ab3afa09fac450ec9a682112b4dd5148a9dd28758e0e742a7f0a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101103211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26181c84eaab3d269a81b0c2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终直线上从后方赶超时\\n会使用末脚少量加快速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "230107a6aeccc06355d46bd2993bdd0c23685f1cb2c199c16370cfb66bbc661d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "10111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbabd5e6c5b221037ab539d4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中段附近位于队伍中间时\\n少量持续性提升速度,若当前位于上坡则提高效果量",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b8008cdc71d99ce1a2c2b4735b186490a209b1bcef00cfa57163c8ea78cc8e3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:637a3185042cc4adef235d7a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当进入比赛最终冲刺阶段时\\n速度在短时间内小幅提升\\n在英里赛中发动技能时，若处于前方\\n效果会发生改变，在短时间内大幅冲向前方",
      "source_fingerprint": "21fe24c7a9a0728cd5d2c9a06786ccc350ab850ecd91eebe4c8bcbdb8f44658d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:191e50a0928e77ce61ccfbde",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛前半段的弯道若位于好位置\\n则速度提升,若是2200m的比赛\\n则速度持续提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5cd685925345e8e8d1d2aef88d2da73562c7921e3c84eb24aede3586f9cacb0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0a1e6f653d206fe4325edfc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中间点位于队伍中部或更后方时\n略微向前突进\n若是英里或中距离比赛\n则大幅向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "24ad6fa032d429a00c0d63cd2d63ce414503d70818b17f735b4e6b390d7202fc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101141"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f66ecbac7da1aec86bdb0230",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在距离终点还有1000米时会持续稍微领先\\n如果是在中距离或长距离比赛且所有\\n基础能力都足够高\\n则会持续领先＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "bad211d4bf084b394db87255239ad34143bd29cf7340862b91058813285331c1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101151"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa4e47dd05868fa53be131a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛前半段的弯道位于前方时\\n速度少量提升,之后在终盘的最终直线\\n位于队伍前方,则短时间内速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "ede476711147a73de9d0cfa6d8e9c017c5c5bb41f46a5d9dd46c811a2346fe02",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101161"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f66788e919296ff2f015808",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若比赛中盘以及往后完成超越\\n进入终盘的最终直线时短时间内速度提升\\n若作战为追赶且比赛中盘以及往后完成3次及以上超越\\n则变为短时间内速度极大提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4edbdfbaa0f3b895e8b42995a3797b934b2aebe57c230a1fd4cc62a2d7fc799",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101171"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfb41e6436ab3b5cf73108ec",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段附近速度略微提升\\n在草地中距离比赛中\\n若技能发动时处于队伍中列或之后\\n则较长时间持续提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "d65c507ac6ea6a36d8adb22632ecd3f5222ee39246a8412e11a97764ab90479d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101181"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b355fa6044f7734aead96e16",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "冲进终盘时位于后方且距离终点尚远\\n则短时间内向前小幅突进\\n如果是中山竞马场或阪神竞马场的中长距离比赛\\n则之后在直线上短时间内迅速向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba7dec2700e8db7f993b22c4c930f728c55de38f9d70f0372105845a4715a199",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101191"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62e98d7862a1dde62578e56a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "第4浪时若位于前方则短时间\\n速度提升,如果发动过「无二」「无三」\\n则改变效果量,短时间速度超幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b00ec977f7032657e9344a1c4fc36af0e8f3339b996780bb75596dadb297d70",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:998786e44cb88f2c1e3510f4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道以后被超越时\\n大幅提升速度\\n并且微幅提升提升加速度＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d97d0402d5517fa96ec8bc74d843bb162081bdcd90444bdc85ac2c539fd7ddd8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101201111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:004c8f55e391784d54f1107e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道以后赶超后\\n在最后200米处速度大幅提升\\n＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee12bfdfe4b7fb0c5208d922a398c00486268f6fc1477d58ed73667f95f7b75a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101201121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7343bc620a8cedacf10910bd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时若身处后方\\n则在最后冲刺阶段的关键时刻\\n大幅提升加速度\\n＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "195ea9eb140b366a583be1ee46058fe7d5eae41b0630c4d03713024d4b6f2e05",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101201211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60f1f1950a3699b428e3a435",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于后方时\\n一段时间内速度提升\\n＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "eed551748df9cc8c25b5414065b97f7cddcf0f58810ce3a38531d5ed543a1253",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101202111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d2a2174aa828682a08732e2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "冲进终盘之前一直保持冷静的话\\n会在终盘一开始的一段时间内\\n提升加速度＜追赶・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d961137cddf08681b7dc2124842e35cc3a413b5d5e2021a4945ad8df7dcf87f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101202211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9c1b73be5657fd78396e45f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘初期加速度提升\\n并小幅向前突进＜追赶・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "faddb079d716fb406f80c66c28271d18414a9c57f33ca40c6fd2c34a596a56ed",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101202221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0a7b18c57b52aef4ec6f9b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道完成赶超后\\n在最终冲刺时速度提升\\n若在短距离和英里比赛发动技能时\\n自身位于队伍中间,则变为速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f13ff3944063a7ecd06bebe009d5043d1d9f1d1cb0040e78b5a18a1d4fc0f02",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7852a1e794aa6e983283c06",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近终盘的某处若位于前方则少量提升速度\\n若是在1600m～2000m的比赛发动该技能\\n且此时位于领头或者距离领头4马身以内\\n则大幅提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf1546c94e6cdc3deb5ce045106715d4ba0c0be2853da1296cc609bd97e2c950",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101241"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17c261ec93bc774dd08ddbd7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半的直道处于中团时,速度会\\n提升,如果是长距离比赛则效果提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "735966de10feed0d3aebd4b76fbafb779f5710cdee3e2fc994868d9a844d52df",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101271"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0fbe2db12716b1b1ee3f158",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在中盘弯道位于前方时，短时间内大幅向前突进；\n若为中距离，则短时间内以极大幅度向前突进。\n之后在全力冲刺期间，若处于前3名\n则在某处短时间内展现出强劲的后劲＜草地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdb167a6ceff52cc22ec8dcf3c594a9db5e16258ddd54a2710f41f24523c4afd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101291"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69c6c350052af11577ff29a9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在剩余1000m处若身处前方\\n速度稍微提升，若在草地英里或中距离\\n比赛中发动技能且当时身处直线\\n则效果改变为持续向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "358910997dc6485ca00d3f3b42a0858b45309545a3cbd9a5f65ebeaa3a052d4b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101301"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8086d2e53d881fcaaa7ce48",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时若身处前方\\n速度大幅提升＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "53e5facb582f28ffaec9e57415552a72d35d693a619f0202029c6ee5ff81f1ef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101301111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9340eb6ae5cb623799d2ec00",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛中盘时若身处前方\\n则回复持久力并稍微提升速度\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "876d5c78bd417366fd80f6e877d8511ccd89a27bf9dc06f1e37ffeb276f69604",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101301211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f7a39fe3fb886f20ba26119",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时回复持久力\\n并稍微提升速度＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "54b629ff3bf9a091a092da93367762a285a481370575d43162d70888b5f84e1c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101302111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c46da68ab7c7cdf7b85f8228",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身处直线时,大幅提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "60d117f0ce7aa178e16ab80eddaf45018f77a8c4f8f6ba4738142f98904b7f44",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101302211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a4f08d0a8e1d8484d9b0eb4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时若身处前方\\n一段时间内速度持续提升＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab48fbc140e0de7f07c0c0e85e3d37a606c07a667320a1f6ef01ff0b2ca550ce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101303111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0904b5b6d84d16c38e7baa6d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若是出闸时没有起步晚\\n则在中盘开始时极大幅回复持久力\\n＜先行・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "5db57e7473d06927b4bd8882ef704254a50ac6aeb6bcd4c089cb5e066c3f716c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101303211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32152faf442523e887cf688b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中途如果处于中团或更后的位置\\n会短时间冲到前方,短距离或英里\\n比赛的话,随后在最后冲刺阶段\\n会短时间大幅领先",
      "source_fingerprint": "41665c3f60c86cea0c164163c5b006226759f08689cecc6ac69d7f08073dee62",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101311"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b6c09c864a3c721a99c34a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛接近尾声时,速度会稍微提升\\n如果是中距离比赛\\n效果会根据从粉丝那里收到的爱意\\n最多提升至3倍＜居中・草地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "175d8f90ae43a9da388813bbe1674a2ae52965a5e8389d8a34f07e005ed22d80",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
